# FuelTrail UI

Follow [docs/brand/style-guide.md](docs/brand/style-guide.md) and the board at [docs/brand/fueltrail-style-guide.png](docs/brand/fueltrail-style-guide.png). Execute with Taste Skill ([Leonxlnx/taste-skill](https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill)) using VARIANCE 4, MOTION 3, DENSITY 6/4.

- Tokens only: Ink `#0B1728`, Route `#176BFF`, Warm `#F6F5F1`, Steel `#AAB5C4`, muted text `#4E5C6B`.
- Sora = `font-display`. Inter = `font-sans`. Route Blue is the only accent.
- Driver: navy header, capture-first. Manager/admin: left sidebar, Route Blue active pill.
- Do not reintroduce amber `#F5A524` or the old teardrop mark.
- Phosphor icons, stroke 1.5. No second icon family.
